WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
It's June in the UK.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.270
The days are long and warm.

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.410
It's summer.

4
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.410
But on the very same day,
it's winter in Australia.

5
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.230
How can one planet have two
opposite seasons at once?

6
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.350
Does summer come when the
Earth is closer to the Sun?

7
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.030
In this mission, you'll find
out what causes day and night,

8
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.790
why the Sun seems to cross the sky,

9
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.850
how day length changes
through the year,

10
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.770
and what the Earth's tilt is.

11
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.630
Your mission: explain why it is
winter in Australia when it is

12
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.370
summer in the UK.
